{
  "bookId": "rewind-38",
  "id": "chapter-154",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34316001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "泉，机甲们涌过来了！它们在阻止我们靠近……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "呵，这倒印证了我们的猜测——\n这辆机甲运输车上就是那个耍了我们好几次的坏家伙！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316003",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：6点钟方向出现复数精英单位。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316004",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>Pallas-A动力下降30%，激光发生器失去响应。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "偏偏是这种时候……现在只有一只「帕拉斯」能开火了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我们距离运输车只有一步之遥了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "希塔，我现在有一个好消息，和一个坏消息……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "坏消息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "「阿尔贝尔」的引擎撑不住了，我们在减速……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "看得出来，那好消息是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我可以瞬间用光剩下的动力，然后急刹车靠惯性把你抛到运输车上去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "你是认真的？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……或许可行，「帕拉斯」可以支撑我进行短途飞行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "这又是怎么做到的？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我可以抱着「帕拉斯」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "好吧好吧，我们真是最佳搭档。\n我记得你小时候明明有恐高症来着？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我可以忍的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "啊？你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "那你准备好！「阿尔贝尓」的全力加速只能维持3秒了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "3……2……1……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "刹车——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316022",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：【希塔】的矢量运动远超正常数值。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "唔——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316024",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>推力引擎全开，维持【希塔】的滞空状态。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "再往上去一点……调整姿态……然后……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316026",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "降落！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34316027",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咣当——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "事件的黑幕正站在运输车的车顶，看着希塔从空中滚落到钢板上。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "老实说，我有点感动了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461003",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>剩余能源不足10%，系统进入节能模式。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "咳……唔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "毕竟我记得，我曾经也是这样努力地追阿尔法军工的某辆运输车呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "捉迷藏游戏是你赢了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "塞拉……为什么……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "怎么还在念叨一个假名字？\n我们都用现在的名字称呼彼此吧，希塔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "为什么要在M城扩散AI病毒？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "M城？真是天真，N城很快也会接受「Eros」的洗礼的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "原因的话，很简单——因为我讨厌你啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34461012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "从很久以前起，我就看你不爽了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-802",
