      "title": "童年的终曲·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34318001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "够了，也就她能忍受你这么长的诡辩了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "即使什么都不做，生活也不会自己变好……如果没有希塔，「极端思维」早就把贫民窟踏平了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "你，不是和那辆废摩托一起……落在后面了吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "不好意思，我是爬上来的。真是费了好大的劲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "都是手办了，还把聚会的地方安排在这么高的车顶干什么？又不是要去看星星。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "泉……你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……嗯，我早认出来了。虽然有时候会感慨那个爱哭鬼居然变成了现在这样……但这就是成长嘛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我本来以为，作为手办生活的我们已经和那个世界没有瓜葛了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "但看起来……我们都很念旧呢。真是好久不见了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "这下子全员到齐了，你们又要开始那让人反胃的正义伙伴游戏了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "在阻止你前，我想先向你道歉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "当初，是我鼓励她去参加阿尔法军工的筛选的，希望符合条件的她走一条更好的路。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你以为她背叛了我们，粗神经的我很久后才意识到这个问题。在你随之离开后，也没有了解释的机会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我们都是一样的……在那个世道，孩子们没有选择的余地。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……事到如今，解释这个会改变什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "呵，承载「Eros」的终端现在就在我身上，想停止这一切的话，就来打倒我吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……这一次的游戏，塞拉扮演「恶魔」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "泉和我……扮演「驱魔人」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "啊，是我们小时候玩过的驱魔过家家游戏！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "真是服了你们，提这个能激起什么情怀吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34318023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "但按照规则——是恶魔先攻！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "呼……还算有点意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……结束了，塞拉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "疼，涂料都要掉下来了。\n把那个什么病毒交出来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "嘁，暗夜的守卫这次要在白天就解决M城的危机了呢——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "——做梦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570006",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "恶魔动作迅速地把某件物品插入了自己的背后。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "喂，你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "嘶——唔——\n……疼得我差点晕过去了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "承载它的滋味真是绝了，好像被人往胃里灌了十斤电解液一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "为什么你要这么做……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "呼，如你们所见，把装有「Eros」的终端和我脊柱上的接口连接——神奇的事情发生了，现在只有我携带它了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你……为了制造麻烦真是宁可把自己搭进去啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "希塔，现在该怎么办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "希塔？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "对，对，就是这个表情。你的理性一定告诉了你该怎么一劳永逸地解决这次的事件。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "恶魔面对着希塔，张开了她的双手。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……破坏我，和我身上的「Eros」。\n机甲们就会停下来，M城还有未来的无数城市就会被拯救。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "我就是事件的黑幕，处理掉我还需要思考吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "来，你终于又可以打着正义的旗号杀死贫民窟的人了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……别小看人了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "别以为——这样就能逃掉了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34570025",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "希塔上前一步，双手紧紧地，将面前的恶魔抱住。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
