      "title": "童年的终曲·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34319001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "骇入？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "蠢货……你就不怕被「Eros」感染吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "给我闭嘴！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319004",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>【希塔】解除安全锁，剩余能源集中至电子攻防回路……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我会把「Eros」清除……然后让你得到该有的制裁。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319006",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：入侵操作会大幅增加【希塔】的神经负担，是否确认？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "确认。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319008",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>加载声线【阿斯特莱雅】:「这不是理性的选择，也不是合理的战术决策」。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "骇入……开始。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319010",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：检测到大量异常数据流动……逻辑防火墙受到饱和式攻击。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319011",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>攻性防壁……展开，电子疫苗……注入。目标识别为【Eros】。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "「Eros」……厄洛斯……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "多好的名字，不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……爱，欲望，金色和银色的箭矢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "唔——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：逻辑防火墙侵蚀程度达到80%……攻性防壁失去响应。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319017",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>建议：【希塔】中止行动。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……继续。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319019",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：逻辑防火墙……【希塔】意识数据异常……异常。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319020",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>※※※※※※……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319021",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "喂喂……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "……唔？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "你在发什么呆呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "不知道……我刚才好像看到了些奇怪的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "跟我来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "去、去哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "别废话了，跟我走就行了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "去，把门推开。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "我知道，开门的时候肯定会有水盆落下来，淋我一身。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "快点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "呜……嗯?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "是圣诞树……好漂亮……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "上面挂着的灯，还在一闪一闪的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "前几天不是过节嘛，我从老家伙的店铺里拖出来的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "……谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "哎，别一副又快哭的样子，泉应该也快到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔？",
          "text": "呜呜……我真的很开心，塞拉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "别贴过来啊……算了，先祝你生日快乐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞拉？",
          "text": "让我……再送你一份礼物吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319042",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319043",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：【希塔】……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319044",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：未知逻辑血清注入……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319045",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319046",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……我……这是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319047",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>目标【Eros】清除进度……50%……60%……预计30秒后完成。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319048",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>……清除完毕。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319049",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……唔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319050",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你醒了！情况到底怎么样了?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319051",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "清除……成功了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319052",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "塞拉……你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319053",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "S-VIII抬起眼，用力地将希塔推开。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319054",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……确认「Eros」无活动反应，机甲都停下来了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319055",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "呃，也就是说，我们赢了？\n你还有什么话说吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319056",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……真是无聊，我不想玩了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319057",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "和我去管理局。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319058",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "管理局？那个废物机构能做什么？审判我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319059",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "希塔，你根本没做好准备。你依旧还没适应自己的身份。但总有一天，天启会找上你——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319060",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "S-VIII缓缓地，向后挪着步子，已经来到车顶的边缘。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319061",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "喂，她要准备逃了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319062",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……你到底想说什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319063",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "我想说——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319064",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "再见。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34319065",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "S-VIII张开双手，身体向后倒去，消失在了车轮扬起的沙尘里。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
