      "title": "童年的终曲·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34320001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哎，这两天真是太忙了，要收拾一大堆烂摊子。总算结束啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "啊呜——刨冰真是太美好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你不尝尝吗？来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "啊呜——还是有涂料的味道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……你要求太高了吧，我们毕竟是手办诶。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "所以呢……你接下来打算怎么办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……我会先休个假。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "好呢，去哪度假呢？去海边玩沙滩排球，怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "海吗……没亲眼看过……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "无论是在那个世界，还是现在的世界，我都有太多事物没见识过了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "这就对了，多找些地方玩一玩……\n你肯定，能找到一些有意思的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "至少总会比上班更有意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……泉，我会变得比现在更成熟的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "好了好了，现在不就足够了吗？\n如果你到时候头发变得五颜六色了，我可不想说认识你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "嗯，就这样决定了！我也跟头儿请假吧，我们一起去旅行怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "啊？等一下……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "话说回来，店长呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我记得店长说……她要去进货。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320019",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "她听见了脚步声，从巷子里的阴影——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320020",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "一直到她的面前。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "呵，07，你是怎么找到我的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我在希塔的身上，放置了追踪标记。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "原来如此……是在接触的时候蹭到的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "她知道吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "她不知道，你为什么会觉得她知道？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "知道又如何呢……我大概也是中了什么毒，变得越来越不像自己了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "你很在乎她，想拉拢她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "闭嘴，07，你什么时候变得这么喜欢碎嘴了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "呵呵，还穿得金光闪闪的，生怕别人认不出你似的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "因为眼前的目标配得上这身打扮。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "——它叫「裁决」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "你真会讲冷笑话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我知道，你还留着「Eros」的原型拷贝。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "噢……看来我还有些用处？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34320035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "你开个价吧。做买卖……我一向公道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
